      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Surgical LLM edits.** Only the marked parts go through the LLM; the rest of the prompt is copied by code.\n\n- `[gen: …]` write what it asks for\n- `[gen spin: …]` same meaning, other words\n- `[gen expand: …]` more detail\n- `[gen short: …]` shorter\n- `[gen fit: …]` adapt to the rest of the prompt\n\nWildcards inside a marker resolve first, so `[gen fit: {a|b}]` smooths a random pick.\n\n**Generate Text** runs on the text encoder you load for the image model anyway. Use `qwen3.5_9b_int8_convrot` for the best spin/expand/fit; `qwen_3_4b` is faster but weaker. Connect **text** to your CLIP Text Encode."
      ],
      "color": "#c09430",
      "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)"
    }
